{ //specific occasions
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.001": "Hey, you must be the newcomer in town! I'm Aliyah - happy to finally meet you!$0#$b#Marlon already wrote to me about you. He's been keeping me in the loop about everything since the rockslide.$0#$e#Oh, only good things, don't worry! From what I heard, I think you'll make a nice addition to the guild.$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.002": "Of course I will! I'm a little out of practice, though, so prepare for chaos!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.003": "Oh my goodness, this is an amazing birthday gift! Thank you so much, @!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.004": "This gemstone has always fascinated me, its shade of green is just breathtaking. Thank you so much, @!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.005": "Woah, is that real? And you're giving it to me? I'll treat it with as much care as I possibly can, thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.006": "Mhmm, I've been craving this all day. Thanks, @, you're a lifesaver!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.007": "Ooh, I smell something fantastic! I'll cook something delicious with this tonight, thank you! Feel free to stop by for a taste later!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.008": "All those colors, shimmering together... How beautiful! Thank you, @!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.009": "Wow, thanks, @! I'll take this with me the next time I feel like dungeon crawling. You can never be too safe!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.010": "Oh, a shard from the volcano dungeon? For me? Thank you! I actually needed one to forge a ring, so this is perfect! Be safe when you go in there again, okay?$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.011": "No way, is that a real galaxy soul? Are you sure you want me to have it? Thank you so much, @, I won't forget this!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.012": "Goodness, it's so pretty! Thank you, @, this will make a beautiful addition to my collection.$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.013": "Oh, what an interesting book! Seems like this would be a useful read before my next mines trip. Thank you so much!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.014": "Where did you find this? Thank you for bringing it to me, I'll bring the little one out to the garden to be with her friends!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.015": "Oh, you got me something for my birthday? Thanks, @! I love it!$h",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.016": "Uhm, a birthday gift?$6#$b#Well, I appreciate the thought...$s",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.017": "Ooh, this smell reminds me of a lush, magical forest. I love it. Thank you so much!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.018": "Uhm, why are you trying to give me your garbage? I really don't want this. $2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.019": "Well, this is new! I'm sure the creatures are loving it.$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.020": "The wild fairies seem happy. It seems the rain was a welcome refreshment for them.$h",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.021": "I could get used to this! Apparently, there are regions on this very continent where this phenomenon happens nearly every week.$0#$b#Those places are alleged to have an unusually high concentration of environmental mana. It's quite fascinating.$0#$e#Hey, maybe the guild could go on a little field trip! Should I suggest that to Marlon?$1#$e#...I suppose someone would have to stay behind and keep an eye on the valley, though.$6",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.022": "Oh, wow... @! Are you sure you want to give this to me? It's so rare!#$b#I'll admit, my mouth is watering already...$h",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.023": "Marlon told me you've been making good progress in the mines. Stay safe!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.024": "My goodness, are you sure?$7#$b#I... didn't know you felt the same. Of course I'll be your girlfriend!$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.025": "I never thought this would be in the plan for me, but it's a welcome surprise for sure!$1#$b#I couldn't have asked for a better person to take on this new adventure with me.$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.026": "Well, hello there! Have you come to change your mind? Just kidding, hehe!$1#$b#I love you.$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.027": "Can you believe it has already been a year since you asked me out? Time flies, doesn't it?$1#$e#I've never been happier. Here's to another wonderful year, and many more.$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.028": "Hmm, a movie theater? I should stop by some time, that might be a good excuse to see what's going on in town.$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.029": "What a peaceful place!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.030": "Ah, what a lovely day. Thank you for making this possible!$1.",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.031": "I could stay here forever, but I suppose all good things must come to an end.$0#$e#And thanks to you, we can come back whenever we want!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.032": "Have you been exploring the volcano dungeon? Stay safe if you go in.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.033": "I wonder what creatures live on these islands?$0#$b#Once I'm done with my research in the Valley, this might be a good place to continue.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.034": "I like the sun, but my skin unfortunately doesn't, even with sunscreen.$6#$e#I need to look out for my health to enjoy life for the longest time possible.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.035": "The waves look especially beautiful today!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.036": "Hey @, why don't you join us? You deserve a break.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.037": "There have to be some ancient spirits lingering around. I can sense a calm flow of environmental mana here.$0#$e#It feels welcoming. They must be good-natured.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.038": "These drinks taste amazing! I should try making them at home.$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.039": "I'd like to explore more, but I understand that Willy feels responsible for our safety.$6#$e#Maybe I can try to get a guild contract to study the creatures on top of the volcano?$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.040": "How could I say no to that? I'd be happy to dance with you, darling.$1#$b#Hey, do you think you could help me practice my moves? I can never seem to remember...$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.041": "Thanks, but I think I'd rather sit out this year. I appreciate you asking, though!$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.042": "I see Lewis is walking up to the displays now! Good luck, I'm sure you'll do great.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.043": "So, how did it go? Are you happy with the results?$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.044": "Congrats, @! You deserved that win. Your display looks stunning!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.045": "How'd you place? Oh, you didn't participate? Waiting for next year to perfect your produce first, huh?$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.046": "Woah, Lewis seems angry. What did you do?$0#$b#Haha, okay, that's just a harmless prank. Maybe he'll run his own errands next time.$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.047": "Hi, honey, guess who's getting you your gift this year!$1#b#It's me, I'm the lucky person. Here, open it. Don't be shy!$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.048": "I hope you like it! Happy Winter Star, darling.$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.049": "Hello there! Admiring the tree, are we? It sure is stunning this year.$1#b#Now for the fun part, your gift! I'm your secret gift-giver this year. You can open it now if you'd like.$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.050": "I tried to find something you'd like. Hope I got it right!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.051": "Oh, it's you? This wrapping is really nice. Thank you very much!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.052": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Wow, this thing sparkles beautifully! Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.053": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Wow, this smells.. *sniff* ...interesting. Thanks.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.054": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Ooh, I could try hatching a little friend from this! Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.055": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Mmh, farm-fresh produce! Guess I'm going to cook something nice tomorrow. Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.056": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Ooh, this smells delicious! Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.057": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Well, this seems... useful. Thanks.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.058": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Wow, this thing sparkles beautifully! Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.059": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Hmm, this could come in handy. Thanks!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.060": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Oh, I'm sure my plants will be happy about this one. Thanks.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.061": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Uhmm... what exactly... Nevermind, thanks.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.062": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Uhmm... what exactly... Nevermind, thanks.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.063": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Uhmm... what exactly... Nevermind, thanks.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.064": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Mmh, farm-fresh produce! Guess I'm going to cook something nice tomorrow. Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.065": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Hmm, this could come in handy. Thanks.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.066": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Mmh, farm-fresh produce! Guess I'm going to cook something nice tomorrow. Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.067": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Mmh, farm-fresh produce! Guess I'm going to cook something nice tomorrow. Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.068": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Wow, this is so pretty! Thank you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.069": "Oh, you're my secret gift-giver this year? Woah, this could come in handy. Thanks!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.070": "Uhm, hi... Do you need something?$6",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.071": "Uhm, are you looking for something specific...?$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.072": "Wow, it's messy in here... I guess I'll try to find some time to clean up tomorrow. Could you clear your stuff from the floor, please? Thanks, dear.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.073": "Where did these come from...? My research doesn't usually follow me indoors.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.074": "Here, darling, I found this for you! I'm sure you've seen it before, but I hope this one is still special to you.$1#$b#I want all the best for you. I love you.$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.075": "Oh... that's okay. Thanks for giving me a chance. I had a good time, really.$2#$e#Please, give me some time and space to process this. We can talk tomorrow.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.076": "Uhm, what? No, of course not! You know I'm already married to {0}, right? Your friend? You were at the wedding...?$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.077": "Hehe, you're sweet. You don't need to ask again, I already said 'yes' the first time!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.078": "Can't wait to get married, huh? Me neither. I love you!$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.079": "Oh honey, you really don't have to. I'm not going anywhere! Get a nice vase and put these on the dining table, alright?$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.080": "...Please don't do this to me. I owe it to myself to not willingly go through this again. You've made your choice, now please respect mine.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.081": "...Huh? Sorry, I really don't know you that well.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.082": "Oh... That's really sweet of you, but I don't know you well enough yet.$2#$b#But hey, good on you for shooting your shot! I'll keep that in mind.$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.083": "Uhmm.. No, thanks?$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.084": "Can't wait to get married, huh? Yeah, me neither. I love you!$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.085": "We're already married, silly!$1#$b#I'd do it again in a heartbeat, though.$4",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.086": "...Please don't do this to me. I owe it to myself to not willingly go through this again. You've made your choice, now please respect mine.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.087": "Oh @, I'd love to, but how would I move in with you? There really isn't enough space...$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.088": "Uhm, what? No, of course not! You know I'm already married to {0}, right? Your friend? You were at the wedding...?$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.089": "Uhm, aren't you married to {0} already? I'm sorry, I'm not comfortable with that.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.090": "Haha, funny joke!$1#$b#...Oh, you're being serious? No, sorry.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.091": "Oh.. I'm sorry, I just don't think we're there yet. I need more time. That doesn't mean 'never', though!$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.092": "Sorry, again, I need more time. Please don't take it personally, I just don't move that quickly.$2",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.093": "Oh, you want to see a movie with me? Sure, I'd love to! I'll meet you there. Thanks for the invite!$1",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.094": "Oh, I'm sorry, but {0} has already invited me... Maybe some other time?$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.095": "Sorry, I have to catch up on my work. I'd love to go with you next week, though!$0",
  "Aliyah.Dialogue.096": "No, I'm sorry. I need to heal. Please give me space.$2",
  //seasonal dialogue basic
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogue.001": "I enjoy spending time outside. It's easy to miss out on a lot of wonderful things when you shut yourself in.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogue.002": "This Valley hides many intriguing mysteries. My research is merely a piece of the puzzle.$0#$e#Still, I'm happy to contribute, regardless of how little it is in the grand scheme of things.$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogue.003": "I should visit the town more often. I mostly stay in the mountain forests, or near the adventurer's guild.$6",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogue.004": "Isn't spring such a wonderful season? I love watching the mountain critters emerge from their winter hideouts.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogue.005": "Marlon says the guild is doing well. I'm glad.$0#$b#I heard they were almost out of members at some point...$2",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogue.006": "Each week, more and more birds return from their winter homes. It's nice to see them come back.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogue.007": "The forage out here makes for delicious meals. And it's cheap, too!$1#$e#Feel free to take as much of it as you'd like. Don't cut down the trees, though. The critters I observe like to hide in there.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogue.001": "I've been making good progress on my journal. I'll have to reach out to my publisher.$0#$e#I like to publish my unedited notes alongside my finished work. That way, my colleagues can see exactly where I draw my conclusions from.$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogue.002": "I stumbled across an interesting creature yesterday.$0#$b#I have to study it further, but I think it might be a new species!$1#$e#I guess I'll have my work cut out for me for me.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogue.003": "Phew, this heat is killing me. Good thing I have my own pond to swim in!$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogue.004": "I've been some basic drawing skills for my studies. It's not easy, but I think I'm improving. Maybe I should visit our local artist to ask for some tips.$0#$e#I saw some of her finished paintings at the Stardew Valley Fair. Her work is impressive!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogue.005": "The guild just received a new shipment of supplies. I heard Marlon might start selling a few more items in his shop!$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogue.006": "The river runs concerningly low this time of the year.$0#$b#I hope it doesn't dry out. The forest creatures need the water.$2",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogue.007": "On warm summer evenings, I like to sit in front of my house and take in my surroundings.$0#$b#With vacation season starting to pick up, I get to watch a lot of trains go by. It's strangely relaxing, somehow.$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogue.001": "fall is such an inspiring season. I should take some time for a crafts project.$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogue.002": "I hope you're not having too much trouble with crows. I've seen a lot of them fly towards your farm.$6#$b#They're beautiful birds, but I know they like to cause trouble for farmers.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogue.003": "The variety in mushrooms this season is plentiful. I find them quite fascinating. So many different colors and shapes have evolved over time.$0#$b#They're some of the oldest beings on the planet. Maybe we can learn from them?$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogue.004": "When the setting sun hits the water in front of my house, everything turns golden for a couple of minutes.$0#$e#It's a beautiful sight. I still admire it each and every day.$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogue.005": "I'm going to run some errands for the guild. Do you need anything? Are you stocked up on life elixirs?$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogue.006": "The air is starting to get chilly. I've been looking forward to this!$0#$b#Summer is nice, but it can be pretty draining as well, especially when you spend a lot of time outside.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogue.007": "I might need to take the train to the city to shop for some supplies soon.$0#$b#I don't go often. The city is noisy and crowded. I prefer my quiet life.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogue.001": "Winter has a strange beauty to it, especially when the early sunrays scatter across the fresh snow.$0#$e#Those days make the gloomy ones worth it, don't they?$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogue.002": "The fairies have been hostile lately. They're fighting for survival in the cold.$2#$e#Don't get too close to them! They bite. Trust me, I had to find that out the hard way.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogue.003": "I hope my heater makes it through the winter. I couldn't get maintenance on it this year.$2",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogue.004": "The town looks very pretty right now. You can see the glow of the decorations when you look down from the mountains.$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogue.005": "We should light a campfire in front of the guild and talk about our adventures. Gil always has the best stories.$0#$b#I'm not sure how much of it is true, but it's entertaining regardless.$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogue.006": "There are less creatures for me to observe during the winter. A lot of them are hibernating.$0#$b#That's why I try to take more notes during fall, so that I still have something to work on during winter.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogue.007": "I think I'll grab a nice cup of hot chocolate and get some writing done.$0#$e#You can have some too, if you'd like! I always make way too much of it, anyway.$1",
  //seasonal dialogue 2 hearts
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTwoHearts.001": "I like to take hikes along the railroad. Outside of vacation season, it's reasonably safe.$0#$b#We rarely get any trains passing by, and the tunnels are short enough to pass through safely as well.$0#$e#Don't take that as advice, though! It's not exactly legal, for safety reasons, of course.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTwoHearts.002": "Clearing a farm after the long winter must be exhausting. Make sure you take enough breaks!$0#$b#If you have a few spare purple mushrooms for him, you might be able to bribe Rasmodius into lending you a hand with his magic.$0#$b#Don't tell him I said that, though!$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTwoHearts.003": "What a lovely time to go for a walk around the mountains! Are you enjoying the scenery, too?$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTwoHearts.004": "I'm thinking about buying a new set of writing pens. I'm down to my last one already.$0#$b#Going to the city just to buy some pens seems like an inefficient use of my time, though...$0#$b#I guess I'll wait until I have a few more things on my list. I've tried ordering delivery, but they can't seem to find my place up here.$2",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTwoHearts.005": "How deep have you gone into the mines? Some of the lower levels can be a little daunting.$0#$e#If you're struggling with the stronger monsters, invest in a new sword from Marlon. They're expensive, but more than worth it.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTwoHearts.006": "I bet your animals are happy that winter is over. Seeing the fresh green grass after being cooped up for so long must be the highlight of their year!$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTwoHearts.007": "Today seems like a good day to go out and socialize a little. The saloon is always so lively on Sundays!$1#$e#It's nice to catch up with Emily every week.$0#$b#We share the same hobby, but we're both so busy that it's not easy to actually meet up and do something together.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTwoHearts.001": "I could really go for some maki rolls right now. If I have the time, I might go out and get the ingredients to make them myself.$0#$e#I've been growing some rice shoots near the river. That's the fun thing about living in the valley, we have everything we need right here!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTwoHearts.002": "Oh, hello, @! What brings you up here? Looking for forage?$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTwoHearts.003": "The mountains hold many anciant mysteries, from dwarves to ancient human civilizations. I wish I could study them all!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTwoHearts.004": "The breeze feels nice today. I'm glad to live up here in the mountains forest, the summer heat is bearable here.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTwoHearts.005": "I stop by the guild regularly to check up on everything. Fighting isn't exactly my strongsuit, but I do what I can to help out.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTwoHearts.006": "It's Saturday again, huh? I guess that means it's chore day for me.$0#$b#I don't really mind. Planning my meals and restocking the fridge on a regular basis helps me stay organized.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTwoHearts.007": "Today is my day off! Time to socialize and work on my sewing skills.$1#$b#Having breaks built into your routine can help you stay focused the rest of your time.$0#$e#Do you plan your week, or do you just take it day by day?$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTwoHearts.001": "I saw a large creature hiding behind an old tree stump today. I don't think I've seen it here before!$1#$b#I only got a short glimpse of it before it disappeared into the forest, but I'll have to study it further.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTwoHearts.002": "I've been thinking about commissioning a wooden watchtower from Robin. It could help me observe the wildlife better, and I could see the sea from up here!$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTwoHearts.003": "I heard that you've been filling up the museum in town with ancient artifacts! I should stop by and have a look. There's a lot we can learn from this place and its history.$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTwoHearts.004": "I found some tasty mushrooms growing in the shade at the edge of the forest. I guess I'm having mushroom salad tonight!$1#$e#Oh, don't worry, I'm pretty good at identifying mushrooms. I won't poison myself.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTwoHearts.005": "I heard some strange noises in the mines, probably from the lower levels. The shadow people seem to be more active than usual, recently.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTwoHearts.006": "My health has improved a lot since I moved here. I think it's because of the high quality local ingredients. My meals have become a lot more fresh and green!$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTwoHearts.007": "So, how have you been settling in? The country life is much more peaceful than the city, isn't it?$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTwoHearts.001": "I put some hot water bottles out for the magical wildlife. Some of them aren't very well adapted to the cold winters here.$2#$b#I know I probably shouldn't interfere with them much for the integrity of my studies, but I feel bad for them.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTwoHearts.002": "The fairies were throwing snow at each other earlier today! I've never seen them behave like this before.$1#$b#This is going straight into my journal! I wonder if they're having snowball fights like us humans...?$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTwoHearts.003": "The view from the mountains is especially pretty during winter, don't you think?$0#$b#Between the frozen forest and the view of the beautifully decorated town down there, it just feels very magical.$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTwoHearts.004": "I hope my coat is warm enough for this winter. I don't really have the time to make a new one right now, and they're too expensive to buy.$2",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTwoHearts.005": "I saw some frost slimes in the upper levels today. They really thrive during winter. Let's just hope they don't come up to the surface!$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTwoHearts.006": "Living in such a tight-knit community is somewhat comforting, isn't it? Life feels less stressful when you know the people you share a space with.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTwoHearts.007": "Today is my day off! Time to socialize and work on my sewing skills. Having breaks built into your routine can help you stay focused the rest of your time.$1#$e#Do you plan your week, or do you just take it day by day?$0",
  //seasonal dialogue 4 hearts
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueFourHearts.001": "Have you ever been to the mountain summit? I hiked up there once. It's truly a beautiful view.$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueFourHearts.002": "Magical wildlife really isn't all that different from the animals you keep on your farm. For some, the only difference is how they are perceived.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueFourHearts.003": "People have been talking about all of the strange things you've been doing around here. You seem to attract a lot of magical forces. I have to say, it's quite intriguing!$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueFourHearts.004": "I hope to stay in this place for a long time to come. It is truly magical.$0#$b#I don't think my research here will be done anytime soon, but I might have to start thinking about a travel plan in case I run out of creatures to study.$0#$b#Moving isn't my first choice, but if it becomes a necessity, I'll be sure to visit regularly!$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueFourHearts.005": "I heard there will be a meeting between all of the Ferngill guild leaders soon. I wonder what they'll be discussing?$0#$b#I thought things had been pretty quiet on the monster front lately.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueFourHearts.006": "Hi, @! I found a warp totem that seems to lead to your farm! I think you need this more than I do.[(O)688]$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueFourHearts.007": "Hmm, what should I order for dinner tonight? It's the one day of the week that I don't have to cook my own meal.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueFourHearts.001": "I saw some deer drinking water from the river earlier today. They must be very thirsty in this heat.$2#$b#Thankfully, it's pretty quiet up here most of the time, so they feel safe enough to come out of the forest to drink.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueFourHearts.002": "When the sun goes down, you can see a lot of bats hunting the mosquitoes all over this clearing.$0#$b#I try not to disturb them. The more mosquitoes they catch, the less I get bitten!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueFourHearts.003": "I've been making good progress with my journal. There's a magical species that I discovered here for the first time this spring, and I've been working tirelessly to document them.$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueFourHearts.004": "Be sure to drink enough water this season! I heard this summer is going to be especially hot.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueFourHearts.005": "I don't think I'm going into the mines today. The humidity is barely tolerable around this time of the year. I'll just stay near the entrance.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueFourHearts.006": "I might pick up a fresh melon from the store today. Summer definitely has its perks! What are you growing on your farm at this time of the year?$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueFourHearts.007": "I think I should start patching up my winter clothes now.$0#$b#If I don't start early, I just know I'll procrastinate until the cold days are already at our doorstep...$2",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueFourHearts.001": "The fairies are getting antsy. Cold weather stresses them out.$2#$b#They aren't adapted to the cold winters here, yet. Originally, they were only found in warmer climates.$0#$b#We only started finding them around this area about a decade ago. It's incredibly how much they've adapted already, but they still struggle during winter.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueFourHearts.002": "I could've sworn that I saw something moving in the river that didn't look like a fish or one of the regular forest creatures.$0#$b#When I tried to get a closer look, it was already gone! Maybe I should set up a camera?$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueFourHearts.003": "On my walks, I always notice new decorations that the people in town put up. Fall is a busy festival season with the fair and spirit's eve!$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueFourHearts.004": "I spilled some ink on my journal... Thankfully, the damage is minimal, but I need to be more careful! Maybe I should keep a second copy, just in case...$2",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueFourHearts.005": "Marlon asked me to check on the ghost population. They can get out of hand pretty fast if we aren't careful.$0#$b#I think we're fine for now, but we may need to go for a little ghost hunting trip next week. Are you in?$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueFourHearts.006": "I think I'm going to have a productive weekend! It's good to change up your schedule every now and then.$1#$b#It's easy to get lost in your work when your days are too repetetive.$0#$e#Even a simple chore day really helps me refocus. It's still work, but I can get my mind off of my journal for a day.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueFourHearts.007": "It's funny that this town's shrine is in the same building as the grocery shop, don't you think? It's nice of the family to let the townspeople use it.$0#$e#I do believe in Yoba, but I don't feel the need to actively worship. That concept has always been a little strange to me.$0#$e#I see Yoba more as a connection to nauture and the world around us.$0#$e#Treating myself and my environment with kindness is enough for me, but I respect it if others feel differently!$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueFourHearts.001": "There's a bat family hibernating in the cliffside next to the waterfall this year. I hope they're not too cold!$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueFourHearts.002": "I think I'm going to buy a heated blanket so I don't freeze as much when I do my outdoor observations.$0#$b#Well, that, and because my heater can be a little moody. I like to sleep in a cold room, not in a freezing one...$2",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueFourHearts.003": "Maybe I should bring a canvas and paint the view from the mountains today. I'm not the best painter, but it would be good exercise for my journal illustrations!$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueFourHearts.004": "I'm starting to think there might be a yeti in these mountains. That would be a huge discovery! They were declared extinct about 50 years ago, after all. I'll have to investigate further!$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueFourHearts.005": "The elevator in the mines tends to freeze in these temperatures, sometimes. Be careful!$0#$b#You always need a plan B in case it gets stuck. It's not exactly the newest piece of technology.$2#$b#I'll make sure to oil it today and try to unfreeze any critical parts.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueFourHearts.006": "I'm looking forward to spring already. Winter is fun for a while, but I start to miss the long days pretty quickly.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueFourHearts.007": "I might bring the guys at the guild some hot drinks. The guild's insulation isn't exactly the best.$0#$b#Marlon usually has coffee for me when I stop by, so I think I should return the favor!$0",
  //seasonal dialogue 6 hearts
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueSixHearts.001": "There are people who collect magic wildlife to host private exhibitions. They often keep them in cramped cages and don't learn to take care of the creatures properly.$6#$e#Humans can be so cruel...$2",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueSixHearts.002": "How are you doing on the farm? I guess it must be a busy season for you. Be sure to allow yourself to take breaks every once in a while.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueSixHearts.003": "I like staying in my own little plot of land because it makes me feel safe, but it's not the healthiest thing to do.$0#$b#That's why I like to change the scenery and find a different writing spot every now and then.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueSixHearts.004": "I'm thankful that the flowers in my garden don't require a whole lot of maintenance.$0#$b#I can be very forgetful when I'm so submerged in my work all the time.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueSixHearts.005": "I've been hearing a lot about your accomplishments at the guild.$1#$b#Things have been exceptionally peaceful on the monster front since you showed up. Keep up the good work!$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueSixHearts.006": "With every passing day, we get to learn a little more about the world and the community around us.$0#$e#I'm not close with many people hear, but in such a small town, it's hard to miss the latest news and gossip going around.$0#$e#Did Rasmodius ever tell you about his suspected daughter? He won't tell me who it might be, but I have a suspicion...$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueSixHearts.007": "I've been looking forward to today! I require a lot of peace and quiet to do my work, but I do need to socialize every once in a while. The saloon is the perfect place for that!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueSixHearts.001": "I saw a strange-looking person standing on the railroad platform the other day. They were wearing a sparkly hat and suit.$0#$b#It was getting dark, so I couldn't see much else, but I don't think they live here.$0#$e#Do you have any idea who they might be? You seem to know a lot of people around here, so I figured I'd ask.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueSixHearts.002": "What I love most about my little piece of land is how peaceful and quiet it is. Even with the railroad, or maybe even because of it.$1#$b#Not many people come through here since it's only accessible through the tunnel.$0#$b#The old entrance was blocked by falling debris during the rockslide. I haven't bothered clearing it out because it was an unnecessarily long path anyway.$0#$b#I always preferred the tunnel, even before the rockslide.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueSixHearts.003": "I'm a little surprised by the lack of tourism in this place. We have the beach, the forest and the mountains, all in one place!$0#$b#I guess it's for the best, though. If people started vacationing here, it wouldn't be as peaceful anymore.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueSixHearts.004": "Sometimes I wonder why the town didn't have any money to fix up the old bus. It seems like a very important part of the infrastructure around here.$0#$b#Unless people aren't paying their taxes, that should have been well within the budget, right?$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueSixHearts.005": "Gil has been more grumpy than usual recently. I think he needs to get out more.$2#$e#Maybe we could plan some guild activities?$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueSixHearts.006": "Do you have any good friends in town? I find it hard to socialize outside of the guild, sometimes. It's like a completely different world.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueSixHearts.007": "Cooking is fun, but sometimes I have to force myself to actually make something tasty and nutritious. It just takes up a lot of time.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueSixHearts.001": "Hey, @! If you go into the mines this week, be sure to take this. No fun adventure is worth risking your life for, remember that![(O)773]$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueSixHearts.002": "I'm thinking about signing up for an archery course a few towns over.$1#$b#Right now, I pretty much only use swords and daggers. They work fine, but I need to expand my horizon a little...$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueSixHearts.003": "An old friend of mine just got married. They had a wonderful ceremony at an old castle up north. She wore a gorgeous red gown with a golden leaf pattern.$1#$b#When the weather plays along, fall is such a beautiful season for weddings!$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueSixHearts.004": "I could really go for a nice cup of tea right now. I always get that craving during fall. It's a special season, isn't it?$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueSixHearts.005": "Apparently, there hasn't been a real monster threat in this town for a long, long time. Marlon has done a fantastic job of keeping it all under control for so long!$1#$b#I'm sure he's glad that you're here to help out now, though. He isn't getting any younger...$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueSixHearts.006": "Abigail asked me about potentially joining the guild at the dance of the moonlight jellies.$0#$b#I don't know her enough to tell if she's ready yet, but she certainly seemed determined.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueSixHearts.007": "Sometimes I wonder how people can deny the existence of magic when it has been all around them this entire time.$0#$b#Emily's sister thinks she's crazy for believing the things she does, and I've heard other people say similar things.$0#$b# But then again, they don't question the haunted maze at the spirit's eve festival nearly as much. How does that make sense?$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueSixHearts.001": "I've been leaving some acorns out for the squirrels that live here. They seem happy.$0#$b#I don't think they were able to gather as much food as usual this fall.$2",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueSixHearts.002": "I like to read fantasy novels when I need to take my mind off of things. It makes me wonder how many wonderous things are still out there, undiscovered.$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueSixHearts.003": "Oh, hey @! It's good to see you. How is the farm holding up?$0#$b#Since there aren't that many crops for you to grow in the winter, how about we go for a trip to the mines sometime? Just for fun.$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueSixHearts.004": "Do you ever miss the city? Sometimes, I still wish that I had my old social life again. I would never go back, though. It's not worth it anymore.$6",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueSixHearts.005": "Every day, we move one step closer to greatness.$0#$b#Keeping people safe, living in harmony with the world around us and the creatures we get to share our planet with - it's nice to be a part of such progress, don't you think?$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueSixHearts.006": "The fabric store I like to go to is moving to a different part of the city. They're having a huge sale right now!$1#$b#I decided to treat myself to a new fancy dress. I'm not sure when I'll get to wear it, but making it has been super fun!$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueSixHearts.007": "You'd think that with my kind of lifestyle, I'd get to spend my time quite freely. That's not really the case, unfortunately.$6#$b#I love my work, but it also means that I need to spend more hours on it than a regular job.$6#$e#Right now, I'm relying mostly on research funds. I need to deliver results frequently to still qualify.$6#$b#That can be quite stressful when you can't control how much you're going to discover in a day, wek, season or year.$6#$b#I couldn't imagine my life any other way, though!$0",
  //seasonal dialogue 8 hearts
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueEightHearts.001": "This season calls for a fresh meal with some homemade lemonade. I think I might have a little picnic in front of my cabin and watch the river flow by.$1#$b#Feel free to come if you want to take a break from your work!$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueEightHearts.002": "Do you think we'll discover every species of magical wildlife someday, @? I'm not sure whether I should hope for it or not..$0#$b#On one hand, it would be a great accomplishment. On the other, it would mean that there isn't anything left for me to discover.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueEightHearts.003": "I have a small collection of trinkets from the places I traveled before settling down here.$0#$b#They're mostly common magical artifacts from those regions. Don't worry, they aren't stolen! They're mainly gifts from different guilds I visited.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueEightHearts.004": "Last night, I heard something moving just outside of my cabin. When I looked out of the window, a shadowy figure was running towards the woods.$0#$b#It was a little creepy, but I guess I was probably just tired and it was only a deer.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueEightHearts.005": "I'm surprised that the children in this town never come up to the mines to play. I would have absolutely loved exploring them as a kid.$0#$b#I mean, I still do, even now!$1#$b#But of course, it's best that they don't. It isn't exactly a safe place for children to play.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueEightHearts.006": "If you were to enchant your weapons, what would you hope to get? I haven't had the chance to enchant something myself, but I've owned my fair share of enchanted swords.$0#$b#They have all served me well, each and every one of them.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueEightHearts.007": "I tried my hand at making jewellry! It looks a little wonky, but I was able to make a necklace in phoenix colors.$0#$b#It even has a little feather pendant. I hope it holds up well!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueEightHearts.001": "I don't get to put as much time into gardening as I'd like, but I'm still proud of my little flower patches.$0#$b#There's just something special about caring for something, watching it grow and seeing it reach its full potential.$0#$b#You must get that a lot as a farmer, huh? You've come so far since you first arrived here!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueEightHearts.002": "As a kid, I always thought that I would become a lawyer or a dancer when I grew up.$0#$b#My plans have changed since then, but I'd like to think that young me would be proud of what we've accomplished!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueEightHearts.003": "I went to the city for supplies and found a beautiful, hand-crafted blank journal in a bookshop.$1#$b#I'm keeping it in my bookshelf to motivate myself to finish the one I'm working on right now!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueEightHearts.004": "Hey, I found this by the railroad. I'd probably forget to go into town to get it opened, so it's better off with you![(O)275]$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueEightHearts.005": "I wonder why there is still so much ore and minerals down in the old mines.$0#$b#They haven't actively been harvested by a company for decades, it seems. What made them leave behind all of these rare and valuable gems?$6",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueEightHearts.006": "I think I need to stock up on my life elixir supply. You can never be safe enough!$0#$b#I think I'll make it through the summer with what I have. I usually find enough mushrooms to brew them myself during fall to save money.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueEightHearts.007": "I often get lost in my work for days, which is why I've had to build a weekly routine for myself.$0#$b#That way, I'm forced to make time for other projects and going out. That's part of staying healthy, too.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueEightHearts.001": "Have you been to Calico Desert? There's a huge skeleton of a dragon halfway buried in the sand.$0#$b#There haven't been any dragon sightings in a long time now. I wish they were still around to study.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueEightHearts.002": "I hope that I can keep doing what I do now for as long as it still fascinates me.$0#$b#It's not a stable career by any means, but I just can't imagine going back to the city and taking on an office job.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueEightHearts.003": "While I don't think I could ever do the same, I kind of admire Linus' lifestyle. No vanity, no senseless consumerism, just living in the moment and being one with nature.$0#$b#He seems happier than most people here who have more than he does.$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueEightHearts.004": "There's a flock of birds that stop here for a day to rest on their long journey south each year.$0#$b#I always try to leave some food out for them and keep my distance as to not scare them off. I hope their travels are safe this year.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueEightHearts.005": "Just a few towns over, there apparently is a dungeon that is much more dangerous than the mines we have here.$0#$b#I'm not sure how it compares to the skull caverns, but I might check it out when I'm a little less busy.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueEightHearts.006": "I think I'll buy a nice bouquet to put on my kitchen table. The fall flowers around here are so pretty!$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueEightHearts.007": "I'm trying to be more socially active nowadays. It's important to have a solid network of people around you, and it doesn't get any easier as you get older.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueEightHearts.001": "It has been a while since I've been to a nice restaurant. I don't think I've gone after moving away from the city. Maybe it's time I treat myself to a fancy dinner?$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueEightHearts.002": "Maybe someday, I can start expanding my research to include magical plants. I think they are just as fascinating as the critters! I think I'm set for now, though.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueEightHearts.003": "I might go for a walk on the beach today. A lot of people only go there when it's warm out, but I think it has the most wonderful view during winter.$0#$b#I wouldn't go into the water, though!$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueEightHearts.004": "The wind is especially cold today, it seems. If you need to warm up, feel free to stay in my house for a while!$1#$b#The heater is working overtime, so it should be nice and toasty inside.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueEightHearts.005": "We're lucky to have such capable people protecting this town. Without Rasmodius and the guild, this place would turn into a living nightmare very quickly.$0#$b#Just imagine what would happen if the mine creatures roamed free on the surface!$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueEightHearts.006": "I don't think I'll ever really get used to running a household by myself. There's so much to do all the time!$6#$b#Dishes and laundry piling up, floors getting dirty, food supplies running low... I can barely keep up!$6",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueEightHearts.007": "I'm considering adopting a pet from Marnie's! I could really use the company.$1#$b#I don't usually get lonely, but winters can be a little rough.$6",
  //seasonal dialogue 9 hearts
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueNineHearts.001": "The fairies are much happier now that winter is over. They aren't constantly bickering anymore. They really do just hate the cold.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueNineHearts.002": "Your visits are always the best part of my day. Thank you for taking so much time for me. I know you have a lot of work to do, too.$4",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueNineHearts.003": "One thing I'll never miss about the city is the level of pollution. I used to fall ill a lot more when I lived there.$0#$b#I still catch a cold every now and then, of course, but it's hardly comparable.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueNineHearts.004": "I wonder what kind of creatures are out there that we don't even know exist.$0#$b#There are so many intelligent lifeforms just in the mines alone, and most people don't even know about those. I'm absolutely certain that they aren't the only ones.$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueNineHearts.005": "Spring always feels like the valley itself is waking up from a long sleep.$0#$b#I've been living here for quite a while now, but it still amazes me each and every year.$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueNineHearts.006": "Last night, I saw you in one of my dreams. It seems I can't stop thinking of you, even when I'm asleep...$4",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueNineHearts.007": "With every piece of progress researchers make, the line between science and magic grows a little thinner. After all, what is magic but science we don't have an explanation for yet?$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueNineHearts.001": "You've been to the skull caverns before, haven't you? Have you come across a dinosaur there before?$0#$e#I'm not sure why they're so hostile. The ones I've seen in other regions so far have been quite friendly, or at least indifferent to human presence.$0#$b#The skull cavern creatures aren't really my responsibility, But I still find them fascinating nonetheless.$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueNineHearts.002": "You truly are a special person, @. I just can't help but admire you for everything that you are.$4",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueNineHearts.003": "What kind of crops are you growing on your farm this season? Your water bill must be enormous with all of this heat.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueNineHearts.004": "People who don't respect nature generally seem to have less respect for other people as well. Isn't that interesting?$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueNineHearts.005": "Do you think you'll ever take over the guild? Marlon seems to think very highly of you. Of course I do, too!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueNineHearts.006": "I'm going to get some supplies for a sewing project I'm working on at the moment.$0#$b#There are so many materials that I haven't worked with before, so I decided to challenge myself a little with this one.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueNineHearts.007": "I think that every magical creature is worth trying to understand, even the ones we may not want to.$0#$b#Back in the day, I considered going into monster research, but I don't think I'm cut out for it.$0#$b#Many of my colleagues who research monsters have ways to stay undetected during their observations. I don't, so I feel safer observing peaceful critters.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueNineHearts.001": "There's a live classical concert on the radio tomorrow. Would you like to come over for dinner? I think it would be the perfect atmosphere.$4",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueNineHearts.002": "If I ever can't sustain myself with my research anymore, I think I'll study to become a marine biologist.$0#$b#There are so many interesting things hiding away in the cold depths of the sea!$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueNineHearts.003": "There's always this special moment in fall when the sunset is hitting the coast just right and everything is covered in a golden shine.$1#$b#Moments like that are what makes me really appreciate the beauty in this world, despite everything that's going on.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueNineHearts.004": "Do you have an idea what you'll be wearing for the spirit's eve festival?$1#$e#We could go in matching outfits if you want...$4",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueNineHearts.005": "With so many magical forces at play in this world, the peaceful state we have here right now is pretty incredible.$0#$e#Thankfully, magic authorities haven't played much of a notable part in the Gotoro conflict yet. We would be in big trouble if they were to do so.$6",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueNineHearts.006": "How do you manage to keep up with all of your farmwork and have so much time to be involved in the community?$0#$b#The things you manage to do are really astounding. Make sure you take enough time for yourself as well.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueNineHearts.007": "Do you smell that? I swear, the air is just different in fall. I can't quite put a finger on it, but it's a comfortable smell for sure.$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueNineHearts.001": "I've always had a fundemental interest in the way the world around us works, especially the parts of it that are out of our control.$0#$b#I guess it makes sense that I would end up doing what I do now.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueNineHearts.002": "If you ever get cold working in the mountains, just stop by my house. I will always have a hot drink and a tasty snack for you.$4",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueNineHearts.003": "Earlier, I saw some footprints in the snow that I don't recognize.$0#$b#I made a quick sketch to see if I can find any more of them, but I haven't been successful yet. I wonder what it could be?$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueNineHearts.004": "I'm feeling the urge to explore a new dungeon today. New cave systems, new treasures, new creatures. Do you get that feeling sometimes, too?$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueNineHearts.005": "Would you like to go to the bathhouse with me sometime? The warm water feels great when it's cold outside...$4",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueNineHearts.006": "How do we explore a world that tries so hard to hide itself from us?$0#$b#There's so much that we still don't know about our environment, even though we have been here for thousands of years.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueNineHearts.007": "Can you believe this year is already almost over? It feels like spring just ended.$0#$b#I've been so invested in my research, I barely noticed the weeks flying by.$0",
  //seasonal dialogue 10 hearts
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTenHearts.001": "I always try to be kind to every living being I meet, even the ones we have to fight.$0#$b#There's a difference between upholding safety and unnecessary cruelty.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTenHearts.002": "Why don't we hike up the mountains and watch the sunset together today? I could pack some snacks and blankets. We can make it a cozy picnic date!$4",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTenHearts.003": "We have a lot to learn from our surroundings and the critters that inhabit this planet with us.$0#$b#Some of the best designs humanity has ever created have been inspired by nature. We just have to learn to watch and listen.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTenHearts.004": "The wild fairies have been dropping more fairy dust than usual recently. Here, I'm sure you'll find a use for this![(O)872]$1",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTenHearts.005": "Oh, hey @! You look great today!$1#$b#Well, you always do. Just thought you should know!$4",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTenHearts.006": "Sometimes, the trains that go by don't have their cargo secured properly.$0#$b#They never bother to send someone to pick up the stuff that falls off, so it's pretty much just up for grabs for whoever is the fastest.$0",
  "Aliyah.SpringDialogueTenHearts.007": "Humanity takes a lot of what we have for granted. In reality, we're just incredibly lucky to have survived as a species up to this point.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTenHearts.001": "I think I'm going to hop into the river to cool off later. This heat is barely tolerable.$0#$b#Feel free to join me!$4",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTenHearts.002": "Have you been eating and drinking enough? You look a little tired.$6#b#Here, take this. It'll energize you a little.There's more in my fridge if you're still hungry.[(O)649 (O)732 (O)226 (O)403]$1#$e#Your health is important to me. Take good care of yourself, okay?$4",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTenHearts.003": "Sometimes I wonder what society would look like if other species were more actively present.$0#$b#What would it be like to share the surface with dwarves and shadowpeople the way we do with our fellow humans? Could it really work?$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTenHearts.004": "Right now, researchers are conducting studies on the healing properties of the Lunaloos. I've been asked to contribute my experiences to their observation.$1#$b#It's a fascinating study that might be revolutionary to magical healthcare!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTenHearts.005": "I've heard legends of a long lost gemstone in the Gotoro Empire that is said to be infused with the power of a thousand stars.$0#$b#Apparently, it was used in ancient warfare to power magical weaponry and create invisible barriers.$0#$1#It seems a bit over the top, but I still think it's an interesting thought that something like that could be out there.$0#$b#A little scary, but interesting nonetheless!$1",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTenHearts.006": "I might take a trip to a magic studies convention soon. It's a bit far away, but some of the most important researchers of our time will be present.$0#$b#It would be amazing to get their insight on a few things I'm currently working on.$0",
  "Aliyah.SummerDialogueTenHearts.007": "Hey, I got you some flowers! I want to show my appreciation. Being your partner has been a wonderful journey so far.[(O)458]$4",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTenHearts.001": "The more we learn about plants and wildlife, the better chances we have to successfully preserve endangered species and minimize the effects our lifestyle has on the environment.$0#$b#That's why science is so important to me.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTenHearts.002": "I wonder what our little town will look like in 50 years? So far, not much has changed since I moved here.$0#$b#Well, except for the changes you made, of course! You've really breathed new life into this community.$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTenHearts.003": "During my last trip to the city, I found a stack of magical history books buried under old novels in a thrift store.$0#$b#Reading them has been pretty eye-opening for me. Some of this knowledge has almost been lost to time.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTenHearts.004": "The more we learn about the creatures around us, the more we realize that they aren't as different from us than we think.$0#$b#I'm hoping that my research will one day lay the foundation to change their place in our society and the legal system.$1",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTenHearts.005": "The fallen leaves are so pretty this year!$1#$b#It seems like the colors get more vibrant every year, or maybe that's just because it has been such a long time since the last fall that I keep forgetting how beautiful they are.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTenHearts.006": "I think that more people should dare to follow their passion.$0#$b#Imagine what it would be like if the system lifted up creative individuals, rather than trying to make them fit into boxes they don't feel comfortable in.$0",
  "Aliyah.FallDialogueTenHearts.007": "Hello there, ${handsome^beautiful^precious}$! How is your day going?$1#$e#I was thinking we could go down to the beach together this evening. The sunset is gorgeous around this time of the year.$4#$e#Besides, we might spot a few sea creatures!$1#$b#...Though I'd mostly be going for your company, of course!$4",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTenHearts.001": "I don't think I'll ever get tired of this place. Out of every region I've visited on my travels, this has to be one of the most magically interesting.$0#$b#There's a calm, but mysterious aura in the air at all times.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTenHearts.002": "The guild should organize a meetup once per year for everyone to catch up and form new connections, maybe together with other guilds as well.$0#$b#We have to be united as a team to be able to take on threats as effectively as possible.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTenHearts.003": "This time with you has been some of the happiest I've ever been. I wonder what the future holds for us?$4",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTenHearts.004": "There usually isn't as much for me to observe during the winter.$0#$b#The creatures are all focusing on preserving energy, so it's not often that something out of the ordinary happens.$0",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTenHearts.005": "Humanity has this tendency of thinking that we are entirely untouchable as a species.$0#$b#One day, we'll have to come to terms with the fact that this current distribution of power in the world is only temporary.$0#$b#It won't happen within our lifetime, but one day, we'll be replaced by some other intelligent lifeform.$0#$b#Let's hope that the next dominant species treats this planet better than we have!$1",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTenHearts.006": "Hi, @! Are you taking a break? I hope you aren't overworking yourself!$1#$b#If you want, you can come over later for a movie night. It's nice and cozy in my cabin this time of the year.$4",
  "Aliyah.WinterDialogueTenHearts.007": "This is a good time of the year to stock up on equipment. I think I might need a new backpack for the mines.$0#$b#My old one is pretty worn down by now.$0",
  //Marriage dialogue
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.001": "The farm looks so pretty in the rain. I still can't believe I get to live like this every day now.$1#$b#Have a good day, dear! There will a warm meal waiting for you when you get home.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.002": "Ah, the sound of the raindrops hitting the roof is very soothing today. I think I'll stay inside and get cozy on the couch with a movie today.$0#$e#You're always welcome to join me!$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.003": "I'm going to keep an eye out for any leaks in the basement. The rain is heavier than usual today, so if any water seeps through, I want to catch it as early as possible.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.004": "The rain fairies are enjoying this weather. The others... not so much.$0#$b#I packed you some snacks from the fridge. Don't forget your umbrella![(O)203 (O)243 (O)279]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.005": "This weather makes me want to cuddle up under a fluffy blanket with you. We could tell stories, talk about the future, fall asleep to the soft tapping of the raindrops...$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.006": "I was checking the gutter for leaks and found this on the ground. It must have been washed up by the rain. Still looks pretty good, though![(O)577 (O)122 (O)119 (O)108]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.007": "I'm sure your crops are loving this weather. The animals... maybe not so much. But their grass doesn't grow without water, so I'm sure they'll manage.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.008": "Hmm, I feel like going for a little stroll in the forest. The ambiance there is great when it rains.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.009": "Is your raincoat still in good shape? I'm no master tailor, but if you need small repairs, I can do that for you!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.010": "There's a documentary about mythical beings in other countries on TV tonight. Would you like to watch it with me?$1#$b#I can make us some snacks and heat up a blanket before you come home for some extra cozy snuggles.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.011": "This is the perfect weather for me to work on my journal. I hope you find something positive in it for your day, too. I heard that fishing is best done in the rain...$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.012": "If you go to the mines today, make sure you're adequately prepared. It can be tricky to hear enemies sneaking up on you in the upper levels when it rains.[(O)773 (O)772 (O)226 (O)527]$0#$b#Stay safe out there. I love you!$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.013": "Some creatures prefer to come out during the rain. I might be able to see them from the kitchen window today if I'm lucky.$0#$b#We live in a good place to observe nature!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.014": "Some fairies naturally seek out human contact. They followed me here from the mountains.$0#$b#I like to make sure they're in good health and keep them company while I write.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.015": "I spent some extra time cooking us a nice meal today. I hope it tastes as good as the recipe made it sound![(O)212 (O)214 (O)907 (O)225]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.016": "It's good to have you home, my dear! Here, I made you some tea. Enjoy![(O)614]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.017": "Welcome home, honey! What do you think, should we head to bed soon or cuddle up in front of the TV first?$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.018": "I spent a few hours reading into a new fantasy novel today. The creatures the author imagined have some great concepts behind them.$0#$e#I can read you some of my favorite excerpts before we settle down for the night if you want. I think you'd enjoy this one!$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.019": "Perfect weather for a movie night, don't you think?[(O)607]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.020": "Welcome home, darling. Here, let me dry you off. How was your day? Not too cold, I hope?$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.021": "I saw many curious critters through the window today. Living so close to the forest is a magical feeling I wouldn't trade for the world.$1#$b#I'm forever grateful that I found someone so wonderful to enjoy it with.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.022": "The watery streaks running down the windows make the outside world look so whimsical from inside. I'm not sure how, but that feels poetic!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.023": "Oh no, you're soaked! Aren't you cold?$2#$b#Here, I got you some dry clothes. I picked up some food from the saloon for us, it's in the kitchen whenever you're ready.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.024": "Welcome home, @! I thought I'd prepare something fresh for us tonight. What do you think?[(O)196 (O)200 (O)610]$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.025": "There was a small leak in the gutter today, but I already fixed it. It's good to learn some maintenance skills when you live on a farm!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.026": "I might take the day just to get some housework done. That way, I can spend all of tomorrow at my writing desk.$0#$b#Splitting the day to do different tasks can throw off my focus, sometimes.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.027": "I found this under the kitchen counter, it must have fallen down. Don't worry, it's still in one piece![(O)688]$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.028": "Hm, I might take the day off. I feel a little drained this morning.$6#$b#I'll make the best of it and finish reading that novel I've been telling you about!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.029": "Good morning, @! I woke up early and prepared some food for us. I hope this helps you start your day strong and fresh![(O)197 (O)201 (O)732 (O)215]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.030": "The fairies were kind enough to leave some dust out for us. Here, you can have it![(O)872]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.031": "Good Morning, @! How did you sleep? You look a little tired today. Here, some coffee might help![(O)395]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.032": "I opened a window to let some fresh air in and heard the sounds of the river in the distance. And now, I get to spend the morning with my favorite person!$1#$b#I love my life.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.033": "Are you planning on going to the mines today? Here, take this. Fight safely![(O)773]$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.034": "When I moved here a couple of years before you arrived, I didn't think I'd be staying for more than a few years to do my research.$0#$b#Now, I can't imagine anything in this world that could make me want to leave this place. It's funny how quickly things can change.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.035": "Good morning, ${handsome^beautiful^precious}$! You look very refreshed today. I hope your day continues as bright as it started! I'll be here, working on my journal.$2",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.036": "Here, I made us some coffee. Have a wonderful day, dear![(O)395]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.037": "I think I might dedicate some time to a sewing project or two.$0#$b#It's best if I keep the little skill I have polished, and the machine doesn't benefit from just sitting around, either.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.038": "Good morning, dear! What are your plans for today? I think I might clear out some of my old stuff that I don't need anymore. I need the space.$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.039": "Marlon mentioned that you've been working on the guild's monster slayer goals. Use this with caution![(O)879]$0#$b#It will help you achieve your goals, but please make sure you're safe above all else. Pack an extra warp totem if you're going to use this.$6#$b#I need you to come home to me tonight.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.040": "Do you think Abigail will ever join the guild? She may not be ready just yet, but I think she has potential. We could use more members for sure!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.041": "I was cleaning and found these peeking out under an old floorboard. I'm not sure exactly what they are... you're the expert![(O)499]$O",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.042": "Good morning! I needed an extra strong coffee this morning. Want some?[(O)253]$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.043": "I stepped outside to fetch the mail and was met with the most wonderful, fresh smell of the forest. We are lucky to be where we are now!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.044": "Here, I made something for you in case you're planning to take a dive into the Skull Caverns soon. It'll grant you some extra luck. Bring enough life elixirs if you go, or else...![(O)204]$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.045": "Have a wonderful day, darling. I'll be waiting for you when you come home.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.046": "Good Morning, ${handsome^beautiful^precious}$! How about some breakfast? It's such a beautiful day today.[(O)201 (O)195 (O)211 (O)205]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.047": "The smell of the sea is strong today. Sometimes I forget that we live so close to the beach. We should go more often!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.048": "Someday, we should set up a nice campfire area next to the house and invite the guild over for a campfire evening with stories and food. Imagine how cozy that would be!$1#$e#Oh, and we could use it to have our own little campfire dates, too!$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.049": "I took some time to re-organize my bookshelf today. It was getting a little messy. I have more time to read now, so I have a lot to catch up on!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.050": "I was feeling productive today and decided to deep clean the house. It was a lot of work, but everything should be spotless now!$0#$b#Since we both keep our things tidy, it was mostly just vacuuming and dusting, anyway.$0#$e#I'm pretty exhausted now. Do you want to cuddle up on the couch and watch some TV with me?$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.051": "Ready for bed, darling? You seem like you've had a long day.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.052": "I've always loved the idea of having a basement. There's so much you can do with it! A home theater, a bar, a cozy library...$1#$b#I don't know why, but building something like that underground seems more exciting than just having them in the house.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.053": "Welcome home, dear! I made some dinner for us. Dig in, we have plenty more![(O)212 (O)214 (O)907 (O)225]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.054": "I've always dreamed big, but my life somehow seems to turn out even better than I imagined.$0#$b#I never thought I'd find a way to make my work and a home life like this work together.$0#$b#Thank you for making a dream come true that I never thought I had.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.055": "Today I saw some interesting tracks in the mud just outside the kitchen window. I wonder who or what roams the farm at night?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.056": "Today flew by so fast, it feels like I just woke up a few hours ago! I think I'll stay up a little later than usual today.$0#$e#I know you have to get up early, but if you want to, we could build a pillow fort and tell scary stories.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.057": "My journal is coming along great!$1#$b#I was a litle scared that I wouldn't find enough time or couldn't make enough observations to keep up, but there's always something going on with the magical wildlife around the farm.$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.058": "I've been trying to teach myself how to make rings from scrap metal. Here, I made one for you! I hope it fits.[(O)519 (O)517 (O)861 (O)887 (O)532 (O)531 (O)530 (O)527 (O)529 (O)533 (O)534 (O)859]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.059": "Oh, I totally forgot! I've been meaning to give this to you.[(O)60 (O)62 (O)64 (O)66 (O)68 (O)70 (O)72 (O)74]$1#$b#I found it on my last trip to the mines. Its beautiful sparkle reminded me of you.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.060": "I saw an unfamiliar cat sitting by the front porch today. Does anyone in town own a cat? I haven't noticed any before. Should I leave out some food, just in case?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.061": "I did some research into different sword types today. I think I'm overdue for a new one, but I'm having a hard time deciding what to get. Do you have any recommendations?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.062": "Welcome home! How was your day? You look a little tired. Here, have some food! I'll get your favorite blanket for you.[(O)212 (O)214 (O)907 (O)225]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.063": "I got a letter from my publisher today. My latest work has been doing well! I wasn't expecting it to take off like it did, but it's a wonderful surprise.$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.064": "The farm attracts so many different interesting birds, I think I might start taking pictures and documenting them! It's great to see that human-occupied land can still be such a versatile habitat for all kinds of wildlife.$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.065": "I'm going to use this morning to take my mind off of my work for a bit. I feel like I haven't been mentally present enough recently.$0#$b#Now that I'm living here with you, I don't have to constantly stress about losing my livelyhood because of the research funds. It has been such a relief. Thank you.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.066": "Are you hungry? Here, I have a little snack for you. Come back if you need anything! I hope you have a wonderful day.[(O)203 (O)243 (O)607]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.067": "The forest feels especially magical today. Sometimes, I can't tell if it's true or just my imagination.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.068": "I needed a little fresh air today. The view from here is absolutely stunning.$0#$b#Kind of reminds me of someone...$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.069": "This seems like a good day to work on my journal! What are you up to today?$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.070": "I think I'll stay out here for a while and start reading a novel I've been hearing a lot about. I've already made some tea for the ultimate cozy farm morning! Would you like some, dear?[(O)614]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.071": "Is Rasmodius doing magical experiments again? There's a strong magical presence in the air today.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.072": "The progress you've made with the farm is truly impressive. I've always found it amazing how much you're able to do by yourself!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.073": "I woke up so early today that I decided to go on a little morning exercise trip to the mines. I brought you a little souvenir![(O)564 (O)561 (O)553 (O)72 (O)122 (O)577]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.074": "I'll hike up to the mountains to observe magical wildlife today. Have an amazing day, honey!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.075": "I saw some fascinating creatures today! Every time I think I've found every magical critter in the valley, another one pops up. I don't think I'll ever run out of work!$1#$b#How was your day? I made us a quick dinner. Nothing fancy, but I hope it tastes alright regardless![(O)606 (O)618 (O)208 (O)224]$0#$e#Should we cuddle up on the couch before bed? I'd love to hear more about your day.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.076": "I think I'll stop by the guild today to see how Marlon and Gil are doing.$0#$b#If you go into the mines today, make sure to stop by! I'm always happy to see you.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.077": "The guild is doing well. Gil is still as grumpy as ever. Some things never change.$1#$e#Marlon said he's glad you moved here, because they haven't had any monster troubles ever since.$0#$b#I'm glad, too, but for a different reason...$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.078": "I still can't believe I'm a mother. I never imagined this kind of life for myself.$0#$b#I'm happy, though!$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.079": "I hope I'm doing everything right with %kid1... I don't want to cause them any future problems.$2#$e#Well, I suppose the perfect parent doesn't exist. I'll just do my best, and I know I always have you to fall back on when I don't know what to do.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.080": "%kid1 is doing well this morning! We already had breakfast and playtime. Here's some breakfast for you, too![(O)195 (O)651 (O)211 (O)194]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.081": "Look at us, making our own little family! Who would have thought?$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.082": "Do you think %kid1 will grow up to be an adventurer, too?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.083": "I have a feeling %kid1 and %kid2 will grow up to be just like you in terms of character. Nothing will ever be able to stop them!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.084": "Don't worry about the kids, I'm home with them today. We'll all be faiting for you when you come back!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.085": "I hope the kids will get along well when they're older. Life can be tough, so having family looking out for you is a wonderful blessing.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.086": "%kid1 took away a toy from %kid2 earlier. I hope they don't start fighting all the time.$2#$b#Maybe I'm reading too mucg into it...$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.087": "We should take the kids out for a stroll to the mountains together. The fresh air would be good for them!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.088": "Hi, @! Taking a break? I made some snacks earlier, they're in the fridge if you want to grab some.$1#$b#If you're tired, we can curl up on the couch to watch TV or take a nap.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.089": "When you first moved here, I never would have guessed that I would end up marrying you one day. It's funny how things work out sometimes.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.090": "Can you imagine us living here together in 50 years? I think we could become one of those really cute old couples, living the dream with a few farm animals and delicious fresh produce from the farm!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.091": "What are your plans for tonight? I've been thinking we could cook something together and watch a movie afterwards. How does that sound?$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.092": "I needed some coffee to help me stay focused on my writing. Do you want a cup?[(O)395 (O)253]$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.093": "I'm trying my hand at embroidery today. Sewing already takes a lot of patience, but this really takes the cake.$0#$b#It's so cute, though! Look at these little dust sprite patches, aren't they adorable?$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.094": "One thing I love about this place is that it never gets boring. Whenever I look out of the window, I see forest creatures moving around in the shadows. There are so many mysteries here waiting to be unveiled!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.095": "I'm making a pair of earrings to match the pendant you gave me. What do you think?$1#$b#The pendant is so breathtakingly beautiful, I still can't believe it's real, sometimes. It's such a wonderful symbol for the happiest time of my life.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.096": "I wonder if my wedding dress will still fit me in 10 years? We could wear our outfits and bake a cake for our anniversary. Wouldn't that be adorable?$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.097": "I made lunch, do you want some? You need to eat well to get through the day happy and healthy![(O)197 (O)200 (O)214]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.098": "I've been getting lots of ideas for experiments and things to research recently! At this rate, I'll have to buy another journal soon.$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.099": "Do you think Marlon will ever gather up the courage to ask Marnie out? He thinks he's hiding it well, but it's painfully obvious that he likes her.$0#$b#They would be really cute together, don't you think?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.100": "There's a mail exchange program where you can write to adventurers from other countries and exchange stories, experiences and survival tricks.$0#$e#I've been participating for a while now. Not only has it been fascinating to read their stories, but I've learned some new methods for my research, too!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.101": "I think I want to explore the quarry mine a little. The last time I went in, there were too many haunted skulls near the entrance for me to go in any further.$0#$b#I'm more experienced now, though, I'm pretty sure that I could take them on!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.102": "How is your day going? Don't exhaust yourself too much! I'll be here working on my research for a bit.$0#$b#There are some snacks on the counter if you need a little energy boost.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.103": "I've never lived in such a big house. How on earth did you keep this clean all by yourself?$0#$b#It feels like by the time I'm done sweeping, the dust has already come back.$6",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.104": "What are our dinner plans for tonight? Something from the saloon, maybe?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.105": "I wonder if Marlon will ever retire. He has been running the guild for ages. I don't think he's ever talked about finding a successor, though.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.106": "I need to spend more time on my obserations. Research has been a little slow lately.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.107": "Maybe I need a new hobby, something that doesn't involve magic or adventuring. Maybe I should join the aerobics class in town?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.108": "I think I'll just sit down with a book today. I didn't get much sleep last night.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.109": "Are you sure you're still happy...?$2",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.110": "I wish you'd talk to me more. we used to chat almost every day. What happened? Am I doing something wrong?$2",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.111": "Do you think you could make a little more time for us? I feel like we've been drifting apart lately.$2",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.112": "Happy new year, honey! I know you probably have a lot to do around the farm today, so I won't keep you long. Don't overwork yourself![(O)349]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.113": "Tomorrow is the first festival of the year! It will be good to see everyone after the long winter we had.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.114": "Oh no, I need to fix up my dress for the flower dance! I completely forgot. The fit was a little tight last year...$7",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.115": "Are you planting new crops today? Make sure to take enough breaks! I packed some food to keep you energized.$1[(O)237]",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.116": "Have you thought about what you want to bring to the potluck on Thursday? I might get some cheese to contribute. You can never go wrong with that!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.117": "This heat is starting to be exhausting. I made us some ice cream to cool off. Have an amazing day, try not to melt![(O)233]$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.118": "Summer went by quickly this year! I'm definitely looking forward to the temperature change, that's for sure.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.119": "Finally, my favorite season has arrived! I think the fall palette really suits me. It's probably because of my hair.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.120": "Blackberry season starts tomorrow. I think I'm going to pick some. They aren't the best food to take to the mines, but they sure are delicious!$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.121": "How is your display for the fair coming along? I have a good feeling about this year. I know you'll do great.$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.122": "If you need any repairs done on your winter clothes, now would be the time to hand them to me! I want to make sure you're all snug and warm when the cold season rolls around.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.123": "Spirit's Eve is right around the corner. I can't wait to see what Rasmodius has come up with this year!$1#$b#He doesn't like to show it, but I know he's proud to show off his skills every year.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.124": "Have you seen the snow outside? It's incredible to me how quickly the seasons change around here.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.125": "I'm really looking forward to the night market. Not necessarily to buy something, don't worry! The vendors there always have the best stories to tell.$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.126": "Happy Winter Star, honey! I know the traditional gift-giving hasn't started yet, but here's a little something for you... unofficially, of course![(O)74 (O)279 (O)863]$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.127": "The years go by fast, don't they?$0#$b#Thank you for making this one so special. I still can't believe that I get to go through life side by side with you. I love you.[StardropTea]$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.128": "The smells of spring will always be wonderful to me. I think it's because winter naturally lacks certain smells, so the ones in spring feel stronger than they might be.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.129": "It seems we are being haunted by yet another heatwave. Make sure to keep yourself hydrated!$0#$b#If you want, we can head down to the forest river to cool off later.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.130": "Fall feels so welcoming in the valley. I'm not sure why, but it seems less gray than it does in other places.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.131": "Winter always reminds me of my childhood. Building snowmen in the backyard, then drinking a hot chocolate to warm up again.$0#$b#But I'm also glad that we're making new memories together. Things couldn't be more perfect.$4",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.132": "My most recently published journal seems to be received well! I've gotten some letters from colleagues asking for advice on specific creatures.$1#$b#It makes me happy to know that my work doesn't go unnoticed. The magical wildlife around us deserves to be better understood.$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.133": "I think I might clean up my room today. Have a wonderful day, @!$1",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.134": "The sewing machine is calling to me. Maybe I should work on my existing festival outfits, or make new ones. What do you think?$0",
  "Aliyah.MarriageDialogue.135": "Seems like a good day to work on my projects. What are you up to today?$0",
  //Extra dialogue
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.RainDays": "I love rainy days. It gives me an excuse to sit down with a cozy blanket and a warm drink. Then I can focus on my writing for hours on end...",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.AfterWedding": "This is so exciting! I can't wait to start our new life together.$1#$b#I love you!$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.Engaged": "!!!$7#$b#Yes, I would love to marry you! I'll need three days to get everything ready.$1#$b#I can't believe this, though I've dreamed about it so many times...$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.Engagement0": "I know we'll be very happy together, @. I feel like I'm living a fairytale right now. If this is a dream, I never want to wake up.$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.Engagement1": "I've been so excited for our wedding that I haven't been able to focus on my work at all.$4#$b#I just know it will be the perfect day, no matter what!$1#$e#Getting to marry you is more than I could ever have wished for. It could be the gloomiest day, and you'd still be perfect to me.$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.EggFestY1": "It's nice to see a community coming together like this. I'm a little isolated up in the mountains, so this is a welcome change.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.EggFestY2": "Maybe I should start raising chickens? They're fun animals. I certainly have enough space for them up in the mountains, too. I'm not sure how the wildlife would react, though...$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.EggFestY1Spouse": "Hi, honey. Ready to win? I'll be here if you need any words of encouragement!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.EggFestY2Spouse": "You know what this festival is missing? Dinosaur eggs! Hatched ones! Just a big family of baby dinosaurs.$0#$b#Wouldn't that be adorable?$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FlowerDanceY1": "It's nice to see everyone dressed up and having a good time. The dresses are so pretty! Quite 'traditional', but timelessly charming.$1#$b#Now, the suits on the other hand... Not sure what Lewis was thinking. But hey, that's just my personal taste. To each their own!$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FlowerDanceY2": "I wonder if the wild forest fairies visit this clearing the rest of the year? It feels quite magical.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FlowerDanceY1Spouse": "Oh no, I don't have anyone to dance with yet! If only there was a ${handsome man^beautiful lady^special someone}$ here to ask me...$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FlowerDanceY2Spouse": "The sweet flower smell in the air makes me want to run through a field in a whimsical princess gown. Perfect for the occasion!$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.LuauY1": "I'm trying to see if there are any curious creatures lurking in the sea, watching our festivities.$0#$e#So far, no luck.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.LuauY2": "I have to admit, I don't really trust a soup made from so many mystery ingredients. It just seems like it would be all over the place in terms of taste.$0#$e#Not to mention the risk of food poisoning that could come from just one bad ingredient.$6#$b#...I think I'll skip it this year and get a nice bowl of soup from the saloon instead. Gus knows what he's doing.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.LuauY1Spouse": "Honey, quick! Do you have my camera? I think I saw something!$7",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.LuauY2Spouse": "Yeah, I'm still not sure about the soup. I think I'll pass.$0#$b#Don't let my distrust of the potluck stop you, though! If you get food poisoning, I'll be there to nurse you back to health.$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.DanceJelliesY1": "The Lunaloos are part of my research, too. It's not easy to get up close to study them, so I take every chance I get.$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.DanceJelliesY2": "Don't mind me, I'm taking some water samples before the Lunaloos arrive to try and correlate its composition with the jellies' activity levels.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.DanceJelliesY1Spouse": "I think I'm going to try to sketch the Lunaloos this year. They're so pretty!$1#$b#My art skills still leave some things to be desired, but jellyfish anatomy should be reasonably easy to capture.$0#$e#Don't worry, I'll still make time for us to just enjoy the view together. I wouldn't want to miss that.$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.DanceJelliesY2Spouse": "Yep, this sure is water! ...I left my testing kit at home.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FairY1": "I'm thinking about buying a new sword. Then again, I really don't fight often enough to justify such a steep purchase...$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FairY2": "It's nice to see the hard work people have been putting in every year displayed like this. You should be proud of your accomplishments!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FairY1Spouse": "Are your weapons still sharp? If you think you need a new sword, go for it. Your safety is worth more than any money in the world!$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.FairY2Spouse": "How is the festival coming along for you, darling? Have you set up your display yet? I can't wait to see what you've come up with this year!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.SpiritsEveY1": "I'm taking a little break to see if there are any real creatures lurking around. It would be interesting to see their reactions to Rasmodius' creations.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.SpiritsEveY2": "This festival would be a good place to advertise the guild a little. I don't think people are really aware of the work we do.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.SpiritsEveY1Spouse": "Do you want to brave the maze together, or were you looking for a solo challenge?$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.SpiritsEveY2Spouse": "I could get used to the town looking like this! Though I guess that would make it a little less special.$0#$b#Hey, good luck in the maze! I'll be waiting here for you with drinks and food. I already went when the festival started.$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.IceFestY1": "This seems like a cozy spot to work on my journal! ...Maybe not in the middle of winter, though.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.IceFestY2": "I brought an isolated flask full of hot chocolate to stay warm. Let me know if you need some!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.IceFestY1Spouse": "I should visit this forest more often, it's so pretty in the snow!$1#$e#Do you want to go for a walk with me after the festival? I've packed drinks and snacks. We could make it a picnic date!$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.IceFestY2Spouse": "Tell me if you get cold! I packed hot chocolate, scarves, some blankets, gloves, heating pads, and an extra pair of socks in case yours get soaked during the competition.$0#$b#Speaking of which, good luck! I'll be rooting for you.$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.WinterStarY1": "There's so much food, I can't decide what to eat! I guess that's a pretty good problem to have, isn't it?$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.WinterStarY2": "I really enjoy this tradition. It makes you think about the interests of people you may never have thought about otherwise.$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.WinterStarY1Spouse": "I'm happy that I get to spend this day with you. You make these festivities feel so much more magical to me. Thank you.$4",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.WinterStarY2Spouse": "Have you found out who your secret gift-giver is this year? I hope you get what you wished for!$1#$b#I'll go ahead and grab some food now, I'm starving!$0",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.001": "I've been looking forward to this! From what I've heard, some of this footage is really exclusive. I hope you're excited, too!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.002": "What an interesting documentary! It's amazing how much we learn when we try to view things from a different perspective.$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.003": "From what I've seen on the movie poster, this one seems like a lot of fun. Get your popcorn ready!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.004": "What a lovely piece of fiction! I'd be interested to see how they pulled off the special effects for this one.$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.005": "I've heard many good things about this movie. Let's see if they were all true!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.006": "This movie had some really amazing cinematography! I wonder how long it took to produce?$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.007": "I'm looking forward to some light fun. The world is exhausting enough, so media like this is a refreshing break!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.008": "Well, that was lovely! It's nice to shut out the stress of everyday life and just enjoy watching a movie like this.$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.009": "I'm always up for a good laugh. Let's grab some popcorn before they open the theater!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.010": "The production did a fantastic job! I think that silly media is just as important as the serious stuff.$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.011": "Prepare yourself, I heard this one is supposed to be pretty spooky! I wonder what kind of monsters will show up?$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.012": "So, did it scare you? Hehe...$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.013": "The reviews I've read say that this movie is really exciting. Let's see!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.014": "The action shots they used were filmed really well. This must be a skilled production team!$1$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.015": "Oh, this movie is a classic! Prepare to be hit with nostalgia. Let's grab some snacks before it starts!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.016": "I really liked the old-school filming techniques in this movie. They just never get old!$1#$b#This was really fun! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.017": "Prepare to get cozy! We should get some snacks and blankets. It's starting soon.$1",
  "yuninocorn.Aliyah.MovieDialogue.018": "What a lovely movie! The actors did a fantastic job.$1#$b#I had a great time! Thank you for inviting me, @!$1",
  "Aliyah.DesertFestival": "I already tried my luck with the caverns. I think it went well!$1#$b#How are you holding up?$1",
  "Aliyah.DesertFestivalMarriage": "Hey, honey! Isn't this fun?$1#$b#Marlon has some decent challenges for us today. Best of luck to you!$1#$b#...Just don't end up in Harvey's tent, okay?$0",
  "Aliyah.NightMarket": "I'll have a little chat with the vendors soon. I'm just enjoying the scenery for now.$0",
  "Aliyah.NightMarketMarriage": "Hi, @! Do you want to enjoy the view with me for a bit? The lights are really pretty this year.$1",
  //Event Dialogue
  "Aliyah.Event.TwoHearts.001": "Oh, hi, @! Sorry, I didn't expect to see you here.$0#$b#Most people don't like to walk through an active railway tunnel, so I rarely get any visitors, if at all.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwoHearts.002": "Come join me on the dock! The view is nice today.$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwoHearts.003": "I like to come out here to work on my journal. Being surrounded by nature helps me with my writing.$0#$b#Ever since I moved here, I've been studying the magical wildlife inhabiting the valley.$0#$b#This place has an unusually diverse population of strange creatures, and even though they live in plain sight, we don't know much about them as of now.$0#$b#I'm trying to change that! There's so much we can learn from nature and all of the lifeforms that surround us, even the ones that seem a little unusual.$1#$b#People are afraid of things they don't understand.$2#$b#Some of the creatures I study have habits and abilities that may seem morbid and frightening, but I'd argue they're mostly just misunderstood.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwoHearts.004": "I know you understand what I mean. You're an interesting person, @. You seem to attract the strange and mysterious.$1#$b#Whether it's a gift or just luck and coincidence, I'm intrigued to see what you'll do with it.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwoHearts.005": "I should probably get back to my work now. Thanks for stopping by, @! You're always welcome to visit whenever you like.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourHearts.001": "Hey, @. It's good to see you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourHearts.002": "I'm observing a group of wolpertingers across the river today. Come take a look!$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourHearts.003": "There's one coming out of the woods right now. Can you see it? Here, take my spyglass.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourHearts.004": "They're cautious creatures. I've never been able to get closer to one than we are right now.$0#$b#They were targeted by trophy hunters for a long time, mainly due to superstition surrounding their magical abilities.$2#$b#Back then, they were one of the more common forest dwelling species. Nowadays, they're incredibly rare to find.$6",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourHearts.005": "I'm trying to learn everything I can about them so I can help their population recover.$0#$b#I've already collected a lot of information in my journal. Here, this is the summary page.$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourHearts.006": "I've been keeping track of their habits for a while now. What foods they like, how they interact with one another, hibernation patterns...$0#$b#I think I'm almost ready for this journal to be published!$1#$b#There are a few questions left to answer and lots more to learn, but the information I've gathered so far could already help other researchers and conservationists.$0#$b#I hope that with our combined efforts, we can restore the population in areas where they have previously been hunted to extinction.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourHearts.007": "Well, I hope I didn't bore you too much today! I know I ramble about my work a lot. Thank you for listening, @.$0#$b#Have a wonderful rest of your day!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.001": "Come in!",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.002": "I'm working on a little sewing project right now.$0#$b#It's a hobby I picked up as a teen, back when I lived in the city. It's one of the nicer memories.$0#$b#I don't think I ever told you much about my life in the city... or anything about how I grew up, really.$6",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.003": "I don't often talk about my time before moving here, but I consider you a good friend now, so I think I can share this with you... if you want to hear it, of course.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.004": "I was raised by my grandma. We lived in downtown Zuzu in a small, but cozy apartment.$6#$b#I never really felt like it was the right place for me to be. I didn't know how to connect with other people my age.$2#$b#I've always been drawn to stories of magical beings, mysteries and wonderous things. I really obsessed over it in my youth.$0#$b#I read every book I could find on the topic. In school, I used to sit all the way in the back, daydreaming about magical expeditions instead of socializing.$0#$b#I guess that must have seemed strange to the others. They thought I was crazy and they never tried to hide that fact from me.$6",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.005": "I never really understood how people could doubt something that is happening right in front of their own eyes.$6#$b#You really don't have to look all that far, even if you grow up in a place where magic is rarely seen.$6#$b#My grandma did her best to help me find myself.$0#$b#She would drive me out to the countryside on the weekends. I spent hours wandering around forests, exploring shallow creeks and trying to befriend the wildlife.$1#$b#My grandma bought me my first journal during that time.$1#$b#I'll always be grateful to her for her support. She encouraged me to find my own path, no matter what other poeple may think of it.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.006": "When she passed, she left all of her savings to me. We never had much, but she still tried to set aside some money to make sure I would be taken care of.$2#$b#I decided to ditch the city and travel for a while. I visited guilds all across the Ferngill Republic and some neighboring countries as well.$0#$b#I learned a lot during my travels. About magical wildlife, about the world of adventuring, about different ways of life... but most of all, about myself.$1#$b#After a few years of hitchhiking and relying on the guilds' hospitality, I decided to settle down for a while and put all of those experiences to use.$0#$b#That's when I realized that I wanted to return home, even though I never felt any attachment to the area when I was growing up.$0#$b#I reached out to the Ferngill Ministry of Magic the same day and signed a researcher's contract.$0#$b#I didn't want to go back to the city, though, so I took my remaining inheritance and purchased this plot of land.$0#$b#The cabin was in rough shape and the yard was overgrown, so I didn't have to pay much for it.$1#$b#It took me about a year to fix it up.$0#$b#My original plan was to stay here for a few years and resell the property once my research came to a certain point, but it's starting to feel like home to me now.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.007": "My grandma was the one who taught me how to sew.$0#$b#I don't think I'll ever be as good as her, but it still brings me a lot of joy.$0#$b#I mostly do repairs and upcycling on my existing clothes, but I also enjoy making costumes and hats.$0#$b#It's a really useful skill to have. Have you tried making something with Emily's sewing machine before?$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.008": "Here, this one is a really simple pattern. Give it a go!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.009": "Like this...",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.010": "And just like that, it's already done! Isn't it cute?$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.SixHearts.011": "That was fun, huh? Now you have your own hand-made beanie, ready for the cold season.$1#$b#Well, I won't keep you from your work any longer. Thank you for listening to me today, @. I really do appreciate it.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.EightHearts.001": "Oh, hey, @! Going in for a cave dive?$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.EightHearts.002": "I just finished checking up on the lava floors. Marlon has asked me to keep track of the monster population on the lower levels.$0#$b#I don't really like to go down there... it feels wrong to invade the shadow people's home like that. They don't get a say in our management of the mines.$2",
  "Aliyah.Event.EightHearts.003": "It has to be done, though. If the more dangerous monsters spread to the higher levels and get closer to the surface, we have a massive problem on our hands.$6#$b#I just try my best to lay low and not cause any big disturbances whenever I visit the lava floors.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.EightHearts.004": "Hmm... can I tell you something that has been bothering me, @?",
  "Aliyah.Event.EightHearts.005": "I've been thinking about how we treat wildlife differently based on their natural behavior.$6#$b#How we call one group 'animals' or 'magical creatures', but another is labeled as 'monsters'.$6#$b#Are they not the same? Could we not treat them both with the same respect?$6#$b#Whenever I go for a trip to the mines, I wonder if I could be better to them.$6#$b#Keeping the population in check is vital to the townspeople's safety, of course, but where do we draw the line?$6#$b#If it's not right to invade the shadowpeople's home, why is it okay to do to the skeletons on the frost levels, or the green slimes above?$6#b#...But it is different, isn't it?$2",
  "Aliyah.Event.EightHearts.006": "Yeah, I guess it's more complex than that.$0#$b#I try my best to show kindness to every being - humans, animals, and monsters alike. We're all just trying to survive, anyway.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.EightHearts.007": "Thank you for listening, @. I'm grateful that we've become close enough to talk about things like this.$0#$b#Have a great day in the mines, and stay safe!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.001": "Good morning, @!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.002": "I wanted to ask if you would like to come over this evening to observe some will-o'-the-wisps with me.$0#$b#I could set up a little picnic near my house. We could make it a date! What do you say?$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.003": "Great, I look forward to it!$1#$b#The will-o'-the-wisps come out around 8pm, so that would be a good time to meet. I'll see you later!$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.004": "Hey, you made it!$1#$b#The will-o'-the-wisps are just about to come out of the woods. Come, take some food and join me!$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.005": "Ancient tales say that these creatures are ghost-like beings who prey on lost travelers at night by leading them off their paths and into their demise.$0#$b#They're said to mostly appear in swamp-like areas. From what I can tell, these ones may have come from the swamp to the other side of the train station.$0#$b#I wonder what drew them out to the forest?$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.006": "It is said to be impossible to get within arm's reach of them. The closer you get, the further away they appear.$0#$b#A while ago, I decided to follow one into the forest, just to see where it would lead me. It's much less dangerous with modern location tracking technology.$0#$b#After about an hour, the appearance suddenly froze. When I approached, it faded into nothingness.$0#$b#I moved closer to see where it could have gone, when I noticed something sticking out of the ground.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.007": "When I started digging it up, I uncovered shiny metal parts. I realized that it was a weapon, shallowly buried in the forest mud.$0#$b#It is unlike any weapon I have ever seen! Its magical aura is incredibly potent.$1#$b#I am convinced that it is connected to the spirit in some way. I spent weeks documenting and learning as much about it as I could.$0#$b#I got all of the information that I need out of it. Now, it just sits in my cabin, collecting dust. Because of its origins, I can't bring myself to sell it.$6#$b#But while I was setting up the picnic, I realized I didn't have to!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.008": "I want you to have it, @. I know you'll be respectful of it, and it will help keep you safe.$0#$b#Here, this is for you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.009": "You've grown to be the most important person in my life, by now. I want you to stay safe, and I know this weapon will help you do that.$1#$b#I want to have you by my side from now until forever. I love you.$4",
  "Aliyah.Event.TenHearts.010": "So, um..$4",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.001": "Hey, honey! What brings you up here?$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.002": "You know, I was thinking of taking a little hike. The view is amazing today. Would you like to join me?$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.003": "Yay! I think I want to go down to the beach and into Cindersap Forest today. Follow me!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.004": "...Huh? What is this doing here?$2",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.005": "@, look! This pattern... it's unmistakable! This has to be a phoenix egg!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.006": "I thought they were long extinct in this area... where did this egg come from?$6",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.007": "I don't see a nest anywhere. It must be either lost or abandoned.$6#$b#No matter the case, we can't leave it here. If a snake picks up the scent, this little guy is done for.$2",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.008": "I'll take it home and try to incubate it. It's a good thing we came out here!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.009": "I wonder how long it will take to hatch...?$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.010": "The fresh air feels great today, doesn't it?$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.011": "Well, this went faster than I expected... look at how big she is already! I didn't know she'd grow up so quickly.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.012": "This morning, I even found an egg on the table. I'm not sure how she did that, but I'll have plenty of time to figure it out now. She seems happy here. $0#$b#This is so exciting! I never thought I'd get this close to a phoenix, let alone keep one in my house.$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.013": "Hey, actually... would you like to keep this egg? You could put it into a coop incubator and see what happens.$0#$b#Figuring out how to raise them may help us with ongoing conservation efforts!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.014": "Here, take it. Be careful!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.TwelveHearts.015": "I'll take some time to document what happened today. I also want to go back to where we found the egg.$0#$b#I wonder if her parents are still around...?$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.001": "I received a letter from the magical research and archeology department this morning, with the most wonderful news!$1#$b#They're having an exclusive magical research exhibition in a few days, hosted by one of the biggest natural history museums in the country.$0#$b#A different exhibition was canceled last minute, so they decided to swoop in and fill the slot.$0#$b#Now for the exciting part: I've been asked to display my research at the exhibition!$1#$b#They're offering me an entire room to showcase all of the work I've done during my time here.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.002": "There isn't much time to set everything up, so I'm leaving today. I'll have three days to prepare before the opening day.$0#$b#If you want, I would love for you to come visit the display before the exhibition opens!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.003": "Amazing! I've already packed, my bus is leaving in a few hours. I'll be gone by the time you come home.$1#$b#I'll see you in four days! I love you!$4",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.004": "I'm so happy you made it! The exhibition will open publicly in about an hour, so we have to be quick if you want a personal tour.$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.005": "I just finished setting everything up. Come inside!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.006": "This entire room is filled with displays of my work in the Valley. I still can't believe it!$1#$b#I tried to organize the displays thematically, but it turned out a little messy. I still love it, though!$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.007": "Let's start looking around. I have so much to show you!$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.008": "Looks like the exhibition is open now! I hope I set everything up correctly...$7",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.009": "...Yeah, you're right, it's going to be fine.$0#$b#Thank you so much for coming. It means the world to me, really. I'm lucky to have such a supportive partner by my side.$4#$b#I can't wait to get all cuddled up on the couch and tell you about everything that happened in the past few days...$4",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.010": "I was going to wait until we got home, but I think I want you to have this now.$0",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.011": "I've been talking to many interesting people here. One of them decided to trade a magical artifact with me.$0#$b#This one is much stronger than the scythe I gave to you when we had just started dating. I hope it will serve you well.$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.012": "What do you think?$1",
  "Aliyah.Event.FourteenHearts.013": "Oh, that's a lot of incoming people! I better get set at one of my displays...$7",
